-- /stdtest engine answers: the client's answers to the read-only calls
-- Blizzard's UI made in the engine's sweep that the engine could not answer
-- (`mock.unanswered()`), into StdTestState.engineAnswers[call]. Generated
-- from the sweep; each call's results packed inside the protected call
-- (Forever crashes when pcall returns very many values).
